#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 25ff0baad44c4b9a8eb7b80496be3ecf
msgid ""
"Aligns onto a common time grid through `align_timeseries_collection()`; "
"exact axis equality is not required when alignment succeeds."
msgstr ""
"`align_timeseries_collection()` によって共通の時間グリッドに整列します。整列が成功すれば、軸の厳密な一致は不要です。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md b723518455944557bc35b25ee2b5b32b
msgid ""
"`align=\"intersection\"` default; forwards alignment kwargs (including "
"`method` and `tolerance`) to the alignment helper."
msgstr ""
"既定は `align=\"intersection\"`。整列用のキーワード引数（`method` や `tolerance` "
"を含む）を整列ヘルパーに転送します。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md af7815371650440e852ec9adb199879d
msgid ""
"Source `TimeSeries.unit` is not carried into per-cell matrix metadata by "
"this conversion path; reconstructed elements are dimensionless unless "
"metadata is set separately."
msgstr ""
"この変換経路では、元の `TimeSeries.unit` "
"はセル単位の行列メタデータに引き継がれません。メタデータを別途設定しない限り、復元された要素は無次元になります。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 7991057533184ef58d859d8be3e38585
msgid ""
"Dict keys are written into element names; generated row keys (`row0`, "
"`row1`, ...) are used for round-trip dict keys."
msgstr "辞書のキーは要素名に書き込まれます。往復変換の辞書キーには、生成された行キー（`row0`、`row1`、…）が使われます。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md ac7795b4e5194cb2bad9566a07688ec1
msgid "`FrequencySeries`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 96c1672c282e40079ec7c04afb678328
msgid "`FrequencySeriesDict.to_matrix()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 96eded9ceaeb44dcb5be1106dd91a81c
msgid ""
"Checks sample length equality only; frequency coordinate values are taken "
"from the first element."
msgstr "サンプル長の一致のみを確認します。周波数座標値は先頭要素から取得されます。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 71b46563b02a441e81fa9ee4b8674941
msgid "No resampling and no tolerance parameter."
msgstr "リサンプリングも許容誤差パラメータもありません。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md bf9681f8220c4a5cab4ea0064074634a
msgid ""
"Per-element `unit` / `name` / `channel` are preserved in matrix metadata and"
" restored by round trip."
msgstr "要素ごとの `unit` / `name` / `channel` は行列メタデータに保持され、往復変換で復元されます。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 9653fda47cc64e958c74dfb6d321f108
msgid "Dict keys are preserved as row keys; single output column is `value`."
msgstr "辞書キーは行キーとして保持されます。出力列は単一の `value` です。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 46da8db4e13a459c8b74c233faa44f3a
msgid "`Spectrogram`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 8c092d2887204234b727f4e4c068ca6d
msgid "`SpectrogramDict.to_matrix()` and `SpectrogramList.to_matrix()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md a032a71844e341d4a61041666b0897da
msgid ""
"Requires equal shape plus equal time/frequency axes after conversion to the "
"first axis unit."
msgstr "先頭軸の単位に変換した後、形状が等しく、かつ時間／周波数軸が等しいことを要求します。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md e7846faa70434ce5a56158c5aaccb72f
msgid ""
"No resampling and no tolerance parameter; comparisons are exact after unit "
"conversion."
msgstr "リサンプリングも許容誤差パラメータもありません。単位変換後の比較は厳密です。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md efcc65208bb94605a100c8bc934d921d
msgid ""
"Per-element `unit` / `name` / `channel` are preserved; global matrix unit is"
" set only when all elements share the same unit."
msgstr ""
"要素ごとの `unit` / `name` / `channel` "
"は保持されます。全体の行列単位は、すべての要素が同じ単位を共有する場合にのみ設定されます。"

#: ../../reference/gwpy_added_api.md 41f534ceb1674742a5e091675929d120
msgid ""
"Dict keys are preserved as row keys; list rows are generated (`batch0`, "
"`batch1`, ...)."
msgstr "辞書キーは行キーとして保持されます。リストの行は生成されます（`batch0`、`batch1`、…）。"

